L290: **DESCRIBE THE PROTOCOL TO CONDUCT THAT DISSOSIATION**
L291: Athletes will be labeled with increasing numbers in an alphabetic order. Then, each variable
L292: will have an acronym, with PRE or POST depending of the moment at which it was measured.
L293: For example, to identify the pre-intervention VO2max of the athlete number 11, the term
L294: VO2Max.11.PRE will be used.
